              "path": ["api", "admin", "help-requests", "{{helpRequestId}}", "assign"]
            },
            "description": "Assigns a help request to an approved, non-OFFLINE NGO. Triggers an SMS notification to the NGO. Setting `taskType` is optional (defaults to 'General Relief'). Multiple NGOs can be assigned; duplicate assignments are silently skipped."
          },
          "response": [
